            "weight": "Essay Question | Target: 4 Handwritten Pages",
            "questionText": "a. Classify Antipsychotic drugs (Typical vs Atypical) (3) | b. Explain Extrapyramidal Symptoms (EPS) and their management (4) | c. Role of nurse in administration of Psychotropic drugs (3)."
