            "paperBadge": "MPMSU Feb 2025 (Supp) Q.5d & Feb 2020 Q.5c [5 Marks]",
            "weight": "Repeated Short Note | Target: 2–3 Handwritten Pages",
            "questionText": "Short Note: Hydrocephalus - Causes, clinical features (Sun-setting sign, Macewen's sign) and VP Shunt nursing care (5 Marks)."
