            "weight": "Repeated Essay Question | Target: 4 Handwritten Pages",
            "questionText": "a. Define Review of Literature (2) | b. State the sources of literature review (Primary vs Secondary) (3) | c. Explain the purpose and steps of conducting literature review in nursing research (5)."
