            "weight": "Essay Question | Target: 4 Handwritten Pages",
            "questionText": "a. Define Population, Sample, Sampling frame and Sampling error (3) | b. Differentiate between Probability and Non-Probability sampling (3) | c. Explain various types of probability sampling techniques with nursing examples (4)."
