            "questionText": "Calculate the Mean, Median, and Mode for the following frequency distribution: Class Interval (X): 10–20 (f=28), 20–30 (f=73), 30–40 (f=115), 40–50 (f=205), 50–60 (f=110), 60–70 (f=88), 70–80 (f=37), 80–90 (f=13)."
